  <div class="sqp-seo-content">
    <h2>Korean Skincare Quiz — Find Your Perfect Routine</h2>
    <p>
      Not sure which Korean skincare products are right for you? Our free AI-powered skin quiz analyzes your skin type, concerns, lifestyle and budget to build a complete, personalized K-Beauty routine — with real products you can add to your cart in seconds.
    </p>
    <p>
      Whether you have dry skin, oily skin, combination skin, sensitive skin or mature skin, KOI — our AI skin expert — will select the right Korean beauty products for you from our curated catalogue of 200+ K-Beauty essentials.
    </p>

    <h3>What does the skin quiz include?</h3>
    <p>
      The quiz covers 8 questions about your skin type, main concerns (acne, dark spots, anti-aging, hydration, brightening), skin sensitivity, current routine, lifestyle and budget. In about 3 minutes, you get a complete AM/PM Korean skincare routine with specific product recommendations and expert explanations.
    </p>

    <h3>Why Korean skincare?</h3>
    <p>
      Korean beauty (K-Beauty) is globally recognized for its science-backed, skin-first approach. K-Beauty products like essences, ampoules, sheet masks and sunscreens are formulated with high-quality ingredients — snail mucin, niacinamide, ceramides, centella asiatica — at concentrations that actually work.
    </p>

    <div class="sqp-faq" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <div class="sqp-faq__item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <p class="sqp-faq__q" itemprop="name">How long does the skin quiz take?</p>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p class="sqp-faq__a" itemprop="text">The quiz takes about 2-3 minutes. You answer 8 questions about your skin type, concerns, lifestyle and budget.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sqp-faq__item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <p class="sqp-faq__q" itemprop="name">Is the Korean skincare quiz free?</p>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p class="sqp-faq__a" itemprop="text">Yes, completely free. No account needed, no credit card, no email required to see your results.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sqp-faq__item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <p class="sqp-faq__q" itemprop="name">How does the AI choose products for my skin?</p>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p class="sqp-faq__a" itemprop="text">KOI, our AI skin expert, analyzes your skin profile, concerns and budget to select the best Korean skincare products specifically for you from our curated catalogue of 200+ products.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sqp-faq__item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <p class="sqp-faq__q" itemprop="name">What skin types does the quiz cover?</p>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p class="sqp-faq__a" itemprop="text">The quiz covers all skin types: dry, oily, combination, sensitive, normal and mature skin. It also addresses specific concerns like acne, dark spots, anti-aging, hydration and brightening.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sqp-faq__item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
        <p class="sqp-faq__q" itemprop="name">Can I add products directly to my cart?</p>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p class="sqp-faq__a" itemprop="text">Yes. Once you see your personalized routine, you can add individual products or your entire routine to your cart with one click — and go directly to checkout.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</main>

